<title>HUNGARY: Hungary three-mth T-bill yield drops to 19.56 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary three-mth T-bill yield drops to 19.56 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average annual yield on Hungary's three-month discount treasury bills was set by auction at 19.56 percent, down from 19.70 percent set at an auction two weeks ago, the Government Debt Management Agency said.</p>
<p>    Total on offer	     5,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total bids received     16,695.06 million forints</p>
<p>    Total allocated	    5,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total issued		 5,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Average annual yield	    19.56 pct</p>
<p>    Average price		     95.3502 pct</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327 4040</p>
</text>
